[{:db/id -1, :working/body "# GPU Pricing Cross-Provider Analysis (2026-05-11)\n\nSource data persisted to RW: `public.vertex_research_gpu_model` (15 rows), `public.vertex_research_gpu_plan` (32 rows), `public.edge_research_plan_uses_gpu` (32 rows), `public.mv_research_gpu_price_compare`.\n\nv3 INSERT additions (DO 8x bundles + reserved + MI350X/B300) and v2 schema (`vertex_research_gpu_provider`, `edge_research_provider_offers_plan`) are blocked by RW barrier-latency under current ingest load (3545 streaming jobs, ddl_max_concurrent=1). Documented here for later retry once cluster is quiescent.\n\n## Cross-provider headline ratios (overlap GPUs only)\n\n| GPU | Vultr Cloud | Vultr BM | RunPod Secure | DO On-demand | DO Reserved (12mo) | Cheapest |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| A40 48GB | $1.71 | — | **$0.44** | — | — | RunPod |\n| L40S 48GB | $1.54 | — | **$0.79** | $1.57 | — | RunPod |\n| RTX 6000 Ada 48GB | — | — | **$0.74** | $1.57 | — | RunPod |\n| L40 48GB | — | $2.06 | **$0.99** | — | — | RunPod |\n| A100 80GB | — | $2.40-2.58 | **$1.64-1.74** | — | — | RunPod |\n| H100 SXM 80GB | — | $2.75 | $2.99 | $3.39 | **$2.50** | DO Reserved |\n| H200 141GB | — | — | $3.59 | **$3.44** | — | DO |\n| MI300X 192GB | — | $3.67 | $2.49 | $1.99 | **$1.88** | DO Reserved |\n| MI325X 256GB | — | $4.25 | — | — | **$2.10** | DO Reserved |\n| MI355X 288GB | — | **$2.59** | — | — | — | Vultr (only) |\n| MI350X 288GB | — | — | — | — | $3.18 | DO (only) |\n| B200 180GB | — | $7.83 | $5.99 | — | — | RunPod |\n| B300 288GB | — | — | — | — | $5.65 | DO (only) |\n| GH200 96GB | — | **$2.75** | — | — | — | Vultr (only) |\n| RTX 4000 Ada 20GB | — | — | — | $0.76 | — | DO (only) |\n| A16 64GB | $1.88 | — | — | — | — | Vultr (only) |\n\n## Pattern\n\n- **Prosumer Ada (L40S, 6000 Ada, A40)** → RunPod は半額。Vultr ≈ DO (Bandwidth Alliance プレミアム)\n- **Enterprise Hopper/CDNA3 (H100, H200, MI300X)** → DO Reserved が Vultr BM を 9-49% 下回る\n- **Blackwell/CDNA4 (B200/B300, MI350X/MI355X)** → DO は B3